OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain over
OL,6,FOrkney continuing, some heavy, but
OL,7,Fturning lighter from the early hours.
OL,8,FShe eventually turning lighter
OL,9,Fovernight. Shetland will be mostly dry
OL,10,Fwith a few clear intervals but some
OL,11,Flight showers will arrive later. Fresh
OL,12,Feast or northeast winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA few bright or sunny
OL,15,Fintervals, but often cloudy with some
OL,16,Fscattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
